: "30000", "image": "frn2le05ob09re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn2le05ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le05ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}